 documents where required"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For development-sector postgraduate programmes, demonstrating actual field/community experience can significantly strengthen an application."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Human Development / Early Childhood Development","NGO Intern / Volunteer","Program Associate / Project Assistant","Program Officer","Senior Program Officer","Program Manager","Senior Program Manager","Program Director / State Programme Lead","Director – Programmes / Country Programme Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative progression routes"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → Monitoring & Evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → Child Protection"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → Education Programme Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → CSR"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → Policy & Advocacy"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → International Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Program Officer → Social Enterprise"},{"type":"h","text":"PhD / research routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential research areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Early childhood development"},{"text":"Child development"},{"text":"Parenting"},{"text":"Early learning"},{"text":"Child nutrition"},{"text":"Child protection"},{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Social policy"},{"text":"Community development"},{"text":"Public health"},{"text":"Human development"},{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Development economics"},{"text":"Social impact measurement"},{"text":"Programme evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc","Master's","Research Assistant","PhD","Researcher/Policy Specialist/Academic"]},{"type":"note","label":"2035–2046","text":"How this career evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"NGO 